   [2m[39m# How bugfix works[0m[38;2;255;255;255m

   [2m[39m1. The lead reads the job and names who may edit which files.[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m2. tester writes a test that fails for the bug's own reason, in `tests/`.[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m3. coder fixes the code so that test passes, and never edits `tests/`.[0m[38;2;255;255;255m

   [2m[39m## Who edits what[0m[38;2;255;255;255m

   [2m[39m- One writer per file at a time; a member asks a file's owner directly.[0m[38;2;255;255;255m
   [2m[39m- Another run of a team may be working here: the leads agree on files.[0m[38;2;255;255;255m

